        <item>
            <title>2.12.3</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 12:30:49 -0400</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/hoomanaskari/mac-dictate-anywhere</link>
            <sparkle:version>45</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.12.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Dictate Anywhere 2.12.3

- Fixed an intermittent delay before recording starts in apps such as ChatGPT. Microphone startup now runs alongside text-context capture.
- Preserved context for transcription and insertion while keeping microphone stopping and cancellation responsive.
- Prevented late context results from a cancelled recording from affecting the next dictation.
]]></description>
