            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Dictate Anywhere 2.12.2

- Added a warm dark theme that follows your Mac's appearance automatically.
- Added a Theme picker in General settings: choose System, Light, or Dark. Your choice is remembered across launches.
- Updated app surfaces, text, controls, and status colors for dark mode while preserving the existing light theme.
]]></description>
