            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Dictate Anywhere 2.12.1

- Updated FluidAudio to 0.16.1 with upstream fixes for transcription boundaries, missing words, and model download recovery.
- Made custom vocabulary matching more conservative to prevent unrelated words and phrases from being replaced by vocabulary terms.
]]></description>
